<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Breweries Q1 profits slip.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Breweries Q1 profits slip.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter results for Nigerian Breweries to end-March 1997. (In million naira).</p>
<p>				 1997	 1996</p>
<p>Turnover		     2,400  vs 2,300</p>
<p>Profit before taxation    305.2 vs 396.4</p>
<p>Taxation			106.8 vs 138.7</p>
<p>Profit after taxation     198.4 vs 257.7</p>
<p>($1=84.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
